# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output (reproducible via `npm run build`)
dist/
release/

# Packaged installers and unpacked app bundles (~450MB; rebuild via `npm run dist`).
# NOTE: exe/ holds a shipped build that predates the SCHEMA_VERSION gate — it is
# referenced in docs/DOCUMENT-SCHEMA.md as the reason "a bump fails loudly" is not
# true for older readers. Keep a copy outside the repo if that evidence matters.
exe/

# Local-only third-party art packs used for development examples, importer measurements and manual
# tests. Some packs require attribution or impose redistribution limits, so the entire corpus stays
# ignored and must never enter source control, installers, release archives or published fixtures.
# Keep each pack's local licence/readme beside it and follow its terms when using art in a game.
# A legacy tracked subset was removed from the current tree on 2026-09-02; existing history is kept.
# See docs/ASSET-INVENTORY.md.
freeassets/

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# Third-party tools kept beside the project for reference, not part of it.
# Pixelorama and Material Maker are MIT (Material Maker's assets CC0); Tiled is GPLv2 — which is
# why nothing here is ever copied into src/. Formats are learned by MEASURING files these produce.
possable tools/
